=== base ===
# Managed Print Agreement

This Agreement is made between Copperline Print Services Ltd (the "Provider") and Ashdene Housing Association (the "Customer").

## 4. Support
4.1 The Provider shall respond to fault reports within 8 working hours.
4.2 The Provider shall keep a stock of toner at each site.
4.3 The Provider shall replace any device that fails three times in a month.
=== amendment ===
# Change Note 1

This Change Note is made on 20 May 2027 between Copperline Print Services Ltd (the "Provider") and Ashdene Housing Association (the "Customer").

1. The following new clause 4.4 is inserted after clause 4.3: "4.4 The Provider shall assign a named account manager to the Customer."
2. A new clause is inserted immediately before clause 4.1 as follows: "The Provider shall provide a fault-reporting telephone line staffed from 8am to 6pm."
